---
// On the bench — products as pinned project cards.
---
<section id="work" class="relative">
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-24 md:py-32">
    <p
      class="reveal flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] text-ink-faint uppercase"
    >
      <span class="inline-block h-px w-10 bg-ink/30"></span>
      Station 02 &mdash; On the bench
    </p>
    <h2
      class="reveal mt-6 font-display text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink md:text-6xl"
      style="--reveal-delay: 90ms"
    >
      Current <em class="font-light">work.</em>
    </h2>
    <p
      class="reveal mt-5 max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft"
      style="--reveal-delay: 160ms"
    >
      What the studio has on the bench right now &mdash; a flagship product, and the workshop
      it came from.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-5 md:gap-6">
      <!-- Poka -->
      <article
        class="reveal work-card relative -rotate-[0.6deg] p-8 transition-transform duration-500 hover:rotate-0 md:col-span-3 md:p-10"
      >
        <div class="tape -top-3.5 left-12 -rotate-3"></div>
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-ink text-paper">
            <i class="ph-duotone ph-device-mobile text-2xl"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="stamp text-marker">Flagship</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="mt-7 font-display text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          Poka
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          Our flagship product. Open-core to its bones &mdash; the Community Edition lives on
          GitHub under Apache 2.0, and the Premium tier is making its way through Google Play
          review.
        </p>

        <dl class="mt-7 space-y-2.5 border-t border-ink/10 pt-6 font-mono text-[13px]">
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <dt class="w-24 shrink-0 tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint uppercase">Type</dt>
            <dd class="text-ink">Open-core product</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <dt class="w-24 shrink-0 tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint uppercase">License</dt>
            <dd class="text-ink">Apache 2.0 (CE)</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <dt class="w-24 shrink-0 tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint uppercase">Status</dt>
            <dd class="text-ink">Premium in Play review</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-6 font-mono text-sm">
          <a
            href="https://getpoka.app"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-ink underline decoration-marker/60 decoration-2 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-marker"
          >
            getpoka.app <i class="ph ph-arrow-up-right"></i>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/getpoka/poka-ce"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-ink-soft transition-colors hover:text-ink"
          >
            <i class="ph ph-github-logo text-base"></i> poka-ce
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-8 rotate-[-1deg] font-hand text-xl text-pen">handle with care &darr;</p>

        <div class="mt-6 flex items-end justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4">
          <img
            src="/images/poka/poka-transactions.webp"
            alt="Poka app — transactions screen"
            class="w-24 translate-y-2 -rotate-4 rounded-lg shadow-[0_16px_32px_-12px_rgb(28_26_22/0.4)] ring-1 ring-ink/15 sm:w-28"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <img
            src="/images/poka/poka-home.webp"
            alt="Poka app — home dashboard"
            class="z-10 w-28 rounded-lg shadow-[0_20px_40px_-12px_rgb(28_26_22/0.45)] ring-1 ring-ink/15 sm:w-32"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <img
            src="/images/poka/poka-reports.webp"
            alt="Poka app — cashflow report"
            class="w-24 translate-y-2 rotate-4 rounded-lg shadow-[0_16px_32px_-12px_rgb(28_26_22/0.4)] ring-1 ring-ink/15 sm:w-28"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Tako -->
      <article
        class="reveal work-card relative rotate-[0.6deg] p-8 transition-transform duration-500 hover:rotate-0 md:col-span-2 md:p-10"
        style="--reveal-delay: 140ms"
      >
        <div class="tape -top-3.5 right-12 rotate-3"></div>
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
          <div
            class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-ink/20 text-ink"
          >
            <i class="ph-duotone ph-hard-drives text-2xl"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="stamp text-pen">Workshop</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="mt-7 font-display text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink">Tako</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          Our self-hosted platform-as-a-service &mdash; a Dokploy-style control plane for
          shipping apps on your own servers. The workshop where Octopy&rsquo;s infrastructure
          ideas earn their keep.
        </p>

        <dl class="mt-7 space-y-2.5 border-t border-ink/10 pt-6 font-mono text-[13px]">
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <dt class="w-24 shrink-0 tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint uppercase">Type</dt>
            <dd class="text-ink">Self-hosted PaaS</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <dt class="w-24 shrink-0 tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint uppercase">Mode</dt>
            <dd class="text-ink">Lab experiment</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>

        <div class="mt-8 font-mono text-sm">
          <a
            href="https://gettako.dev"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-ink-soft transition-colors hover:text-ink"
          >
            gettako.dev <i class="ph ph-arrow-up-right"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-12 text-center">
      <a
        href="/workshop"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 font-mono text-sm text-ink underline decoration-marker/60 decoration-2 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-marker"
      >
        See everything in the workshop <i class="ph ph-arrow-right"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
